{"id":"0b9a1e5c-6f24-4d31-9c77-2c5c0a7f1d10","revision":0,"last_node_id":203,"last_link_id":361,"nodes":[{"id":92,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[750,4870],"size":[1380,860.6315789473684],"flags":{},"order":20,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":260},{"localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"格式","name":"format","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"编解码器","name":"format.codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format.codec"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"编码器","name":"codec","shape":7,"type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0"},"widgets_values":["video/pose/MiniMax_H3","auto","auto","auto"],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"video/pose/MiniMax_H3","format":"auto","format.codec":"auto","codec":"auto"}},{"id":117,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2500,4850],"size":[440,740],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: Model Links","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Model files\n\n**LynnReal (this release)**\n\n- `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n\n**MiniMax H3 components** (from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3))\n\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n- `minimaxh3_art_is_explosion.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/embeddings/`\n  (the prompt references it as `embedding:minimaxh3_art_is_explosion`)\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Model files\n\n**LynnReal (this release)**\n\n- `lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n\n**MiniMax H3 components** (from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3))\n\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n- `minimaxh3_art_is_explosion.safetensors` → `ComfyUI/models/embeddings/`\n  (the prompt references it as `embedding:minimaxh3_art_is_explosion`)\n"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":119,"type":"VAELoader","pos":[-1490,5490],"size":[640,70],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vae名称","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[251,273]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAELoader","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","models":[{"name":"minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors","directory":"vae"}]},"widgets_values":["minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"vae_name":"minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors"}},{"id":120,"type":"VAELoader","pos":[-1490,5630],"size":[650,70],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vae名称","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[250]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAELoader","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","models":[{"name":"minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors","directory":"vae"}]},"widgets_values":["minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"vae_name":"minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors"}},{"id":121,"type":"VAEDecodeAudio","pos":[20,5750],"size":[230,60],"flags":{"collap